OpenVerify matching tables (packages/checks/data)
=================================================

The tables in this folder are generated by packages/checks/scripts/build-matching-data.ts and
packages/checks/scripts/build-nicknames.ts. Each third-party source is pinned in
data/manifest.json (or, for Wikidata, recorded in nicknames-wikidata.tsv) with its commit and
SHA-256. Their notices follow.


1. matching-dictionaries.json
-----------------------------

Derived from libpostal (https://github.com/openvenues/libpostal), commit
25099c506612b34b23b1bfe286ca6321fcf06f35, resources/dictionaries/<language>/: street_types,
directionals, unit_types_numbered, concatenated_suffixes_separable, toponyms, personal_titles,
personal_suffixes and company_types for en, de, fr, es, it, nl and pt. Changes: every phrase is
folded (lower case, marks removed, punctuation as spaces), classes are merged by canonical form,
and one-letter variants are left out except for directionals and generational suffixes.
